# allowed actually arrive. On `20260906` a second filter by name inside sow_project.sh discarded an
# allowed room, the projection ran, and sow_witness answered GREEN -- because a room that ships no
# bytes leaks no names (REDS %485). A publish is as wrong when a room is missing as when a name
# leaks, and quieter.
