# amphora_bounds_agree -- the ninth, and the meter that finds unheard guards could not see it.
#
# WHAT IT PROVES. Amphora names the same bound in more than one roof, and this guard proves those
# copies agree. Three readings: same-name declarations across module roofs; value groups aliased
# under three names and two widths; and twelve declared `/// couples:` markers, where a bound in
# one file must equal a named partner in another -- `max_vessel_len` against `vessel_seal` and
# `vessel_core` at u32=8192, `max_resin_bytes` against `vessel_seal.max_seal_plain` at u32=1024,
# and `max_wire_payload` against main's chunk datagram at u32=340 beside u16=340, the width
# difference carried in a note rather than swallowed. Coupling is DECLARED rather than inferred,
# so a partner is named by a hand and never guessed from a matching number.
#
# Nothing else in this tree checks that a bound raised in one roof was raised in the other, and
# REDS %453 (`20260906.010047`) is what that costs: two Amphora bounds tied by hand at comptime,
# a lap after a raise to one of them refused 64 of 2,200 legal lengths with its own selftest
# still GREEN. This guard is the standing form of that repair.
#
# IT ALREADY CARRIES THE HALF A GREEN READING CANNOT SHOW. Six plants run before any total is
# believed -- same-name, alias and couples -- each proven to FAIL on a divergent plant and PASS
# on an agreeing one, so the refusal is proven from the failing side rather than assumed.
#
# `tier lap`, and the reading carries the pier's state rather than a bare number. Exit 0 on three
# consecutive runs at 1.755s, 1.782s and 1.780s on a quiet pier (`20260906.034025`), and at
# 3.153s, 2.869s and 2.687s at load average 10.2 with all eight ships opening a lap at once
# (`20260906.034409`) -- against full lap passes of 658 and 808 seconds measured the same two
# ways. A wall-clock figure on a shared pier is a reading of the pier as much as of the guard, so
# a lap that meets the slower number has met the expected one. Under two seconds quiet and under
# four loaded, this stays lap-tier under either sky. The affordable witness is the one that keeps
# being run.
#
# WHY IT STOOD HEARD BY NOTHING FOR 36 DAYS, booked as REDS (`20260906.034025`). It has been
# GREEN and cited in counsel since `20260801`, and `tools/fixtures/u/unheard_guard_scan.sh` never
