# gated -- those run to completion and publish counts computed from a deleted directory, observed
# on two of this tree's own fixtures at exit 0 with every count collapsed to zero. Both were
# caught, because the witness above them asserts on the counts that collapsed; a witness asserting
# only a ceiling would not be, since a ceiling claim reads MORE true when the evidence is gone.
# Study: external-research/20260906-102443_the-severity-lives-in-the-witness.md. `tier lap`: 6s.

guard signal_trap
